sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Backend
  participant AG as Agent (Tools SAST)

  U->>FE: Pilih file .zip & model, klik "Run Static Scan"
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/static/scan (file .zip)
  API-->>FE: 202 Accepted (scan_id)
  Note over API,AG: Analisis berjalan di background

  API->>AG: Ekstrak ZIP, mulai analisis
  loop Sampai selesai
    AG->>AG: Pilih tool SAST (semgrep / gitleaks / osv), catat temuan
  end
  AG->>API: Simpan temuan + laporan, hapus workspace

  loop User cek berkala
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/scans/{scan_id}
    API-->>FE: Status (running / selesai)
  end
  FE-->>U: Tampilkan hasil scan + laporan
